# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Flutter apps (fitbook_desktop / fitbook_mobile)
#
# Each app carries its own .gitignore for the standard Flutter
# artifacts (build/, .dart_tool/, symbols). Only the extras go here.
#
# The bundled Inter font files under */assets/fonts/ ARE committed
# on purpose - both apps must render correctly offline during the
# review, so the typeface cannot be a runtime download.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------

# Golden-test failure artifacts
**/test/failures/

# Generated platform scaffolding not covered per-app
**/android/.gradle/
**/android/local.properties
**/windows/flutter/ephemeral/
